rSummary lines={lines} sortByName /&gt;` now prop accepts readonly. Good.\n\nPotential test requirement perhaps test `OrderSummary` with `Object.freeze([...])` but current test lines inferred as `readonly Readonly&lt;...&gt;[]`; JSX prop compile okay. No test library needed.\n\nCould improve test to assert summary order robustly, because `indexOf(\"Cups\")` may find \"Cups\" in `aria`? no. `html.indexOf` case. Fine.\n\nCould assert cart list order by extracting `&lt;ol&gt;`, because current `html.indexOf('data-sku=\"t-1\"')` finds cart list first, as intended. If summary markup order changes no issue. It tests first occurrences only. Fine.\n\nNeed maybe test render twice with same *mutable* lines, not frozen? Frozen tests enough; requirement cart page order every render. We do frozen. Since no mutation, pass.\n\nNeed check npm install created package-lock despite `--no-package-lock`; status.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_1e62132dc001T2Hg9sGNhU5ZRE","sessionID":"ses_e19df6e6bffekA8iWbamfePffZ","messageID":"msg_1e6211c1b001LhhzoETXuJGiw3"}}
